WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.667
Comfyrizz turns a short brief into a finished product video.

cue-2
00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:05.733
Everything renders on this machine.

cue-3
00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:10.167
Every asset starts as a package entry, so the storyboard stays the source of truth.

cue-4
00:00:12.967 --> 00:00:19.967
The asset router sends icons and diagrams to generated SVG, and marks heavier stills for the GPU.

cue-5
00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:25.400
A full CPU pass takes a few minutes, with no network and no cloud runtime.

cue-6
00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:31.700
The timeline locks integer frames at thirty per second, so the export matches the plan exactly.

cue-7
00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:39.267
Three rules keep it honest: measure the speech, never clip the copy, and label every estimate.

cue-8
00:00:39.967 --> 00:00:42.833
Ready to render, locally and deterministically.
